8
00:00:22,659 --> 00:00:27,399
Run the existing tests from the training
checkout in the approved environment.

9
00:00:27,923 --> 00:00:32,623
The suite goes green. Now read the test
names. There’s one test each for one,

10
00:00:32,701 --> 00:00:34,097
