16
00:00:54,824 --> 00:00:58,299
The proposed cause is the
greater-than-or-equal comparison.

17
00:00:58,701 --> 00:01:03,811
Read the line and substitute zero. Zero
equals zero, so the expression is true.

18
00:01:04,290 --> 00:01:09,609
Now we have a prediction. An assertion
expecting false for zero should fail on

19
00:01:09,609 --> 00:01:10,731
