20
00:01:12,537 --> 00:01:16,577
Ask Agent to add just the zero
regression to the existing test class.

21
00:01:17,123 --> 00:01:21,452
Inspect the proposed patch. It should
call the public function with zero and

22
00:01:21,452 --> 00:01:22,282
